# ── Security declarations ─────────────────────────
# Key Management [private_dc]: Encrypted Kubernetes Secrets for workloads; enterprise vault-backed rotation for Kafka, API, SAP, and database service credentials
# Key Management [azure]: Azure Key Vault with managed identity for CMP-36 Kafka credentials and certificates
# User Auth (Internal): INF-14 | ADFS / SAML 2.0 signed assertions over TLS 1.3; existing sessions cached for WAN resilience
# User Auth (External): Not applicable - plant intranet users only / Not applicable
